    "title": "App Lock - Fingerprint Lock",
    "description": "Get full protection with App Lock - Fingerprint Lock! Lock apps, hide photos, videos and messages with <b>PIN, pattern or fingerprint</b>. Download now for 100% security!\r\n\r\n\r\nWHAT APP LOCK CAN DO FOR YOU:\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcf5 Prevent others from snooping on your social media chats, messages, emails, payment bills, and more.\r\n\ud83d\udd12 Lock your private photos and videos to avoid accidental access if someone borrows your phone. \r\n\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Keep your kids from making unauthorized payments or deleting important files from your phone. \r\n\r\n\r\nALL-ROUND PROTECTION\r\n\r\n<b>Lock All Your Apps</b> - WhatsApp, Messenger, Facebook, Google Play, PayPal, Settings and more. Keep your conversations and data safe. No more worrying about your privacy!\r\n\r\n<b>Hide Personal Files</b> - Hide your private photos and videos in Gallery Lock. No one can view them without the password.\r\n\r\n<b>Multiple Lock Types</b> - Secure your apps with multiple lock types, including PIN, pattern and fingerprint. \r\n\r\n<b>Icon Camouflage</b> - Change the icon of App Lock and disguise it as a different app, such as Calculator, Weather, etc., thereby providing an additional layer of security for the protected apps.\r\n\r\n<b>Intruder Selfies</b> - App Lock will capture photos of the intruders and notify you of any unauthorized access attempts!\r\n\r\n\r\n\ud83c\udf1f MORE FEATURES\r\n\u2714 Make pattern line invisible\r\n\u2714 Uninstall protection\r\n\u2714 Random keyboard\r\n\u2714 Variety of colorful themes\r\n\u2714 Customizable re-lock time\r\n\u2714 Lock newly installed apps\r\n\r\n\r\n\u2728 UPCOMING FEATURES\r\n\u25cf <b>Junk file cleaner:</b> Clear ad spam/caches/similar photos/large videos/screenshots to streamline your storage space! \r\n\u25cf <b>Notification encryption:</b> Hide encrypted notifications from the system's notification panel, and only accessible to you in App Lock.\r\n\u25cf <b>Cloud backup:</b> Never worry about losing your files anymore - back them up to the cloud in one click.\r\n\r\n\r\nAbout Permission\r\nAll Files Access permission is required to hide your private files. Please rest assured that it is only used for file protection and won\u2019t be used for any other purposes.\r\n\r\nYour experience and feedback are valuable to us. We welcome any questions or suggestions from you, please don't hesitate to contact us at lockappfeedback@gmail.com.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Get full protection with App Lock - Fingerprint Lock! Lock apps, hide photos, videos and messages with <b>PIN, pattern or fingerprint</b>. Download now for 100% security!<br><br><br>WHAT APP LOCK CAN DO FOR YOU:<br><br>\ud83d\udcf5 Prevent others from snooping on your social media chats, messages, emails, payment bills, and more.<br>\ud83d\udd12 Lock your private photos and videos to avoid accidental access if someone borrows your phone. <br>\ud83d\udee1\ufe0f Keep your kids from making unauthorized payments or deleting important files from your phone. <br><br><br>ALL-ROUND PROTECTION<br><br><b>Lock All Your Apps</b> - WhatsApp, Messenger, Facebook, Google Play, PayPal, Settings and more. Keep your conversations and data safe. No more worrying about your privacy!<br><br><b>Hide Personal Files</b> - Hide your private photos and videos in Gallery Lock. No one can view them without the password.<br><br><b>Multiple Lock Types</b> - Secure your apps with multiple lock types, including PIN, pattern and fingerprint. <br><br><b>Icon Camouflage</b> - Change the icon of App Lock and disguise it as a different app, such as Calculator, Weather, etc., thereby providing an additional layer of security for the protected apps.<br><br><b>Intruder Selfies</b> - App Lock will capture photos of the intruders and notify you of any unauthorized access attempts!<br><br><br>\ud83c\udf1f MORE FEATURES<br>\u2714 Make pattern line invisible<br>\u2714 Uninstall protection<br>\u2714 Random keyboard<br>\u2714 Variety of colorful themes<br>\u2714 Customizable re-lock time<br>\u2714 Lock newly installed apps<br><br><br>\u2728 UPCOMING FEATURES<br>\u25cf <b>Junk file cleaner:</b> Clear ad spam/caches/similar photos/large videos/screenshots to streamline your storage space! <br>\u25cf <b>Notification encryption:</b> Hide encrypted notifications from the system&#39;s notification panel, and only accessible to you in App Lock.<br>\u25cf <b>Cloud backup:</b> Never worry about losing your files anymore - back them up to the cloud in one click.<br><br><br>About Permission<br>All Files Access permission is required to hide your private files. Please rest assured that it is only used for file protection and won\u2019t be used for any other purposes.<br><br>Your experience and feedback are valuable to us. We welcome any questions or suggestions from you, please don&#39;t hesitate to contact us at lockappfeedback@gmail.com.",
